  "2": {
    "left": "<font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\">창문에 고리가 있음.</span></font><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><br></div>",
    "right": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\">오늘은 날씨가 좋지 않아 음식으로 끼니를 때우고 아프진 않습니다. 오렌지가 갈라지면 팔각이라는 것인데 향이 좋습니다</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\">.</span></span><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"> 접시의 먼지가 없는것은 조명이 밝아서겠지. Schweppes에 맺힌 물방울은 참으로 아름답고 사랑받아 마땅한 기준이다. 내게는 누가 제일인지 오히려 눈에 띄게 늘은 모양이다.</span><br></span></div>",
    "date": "2026-01-20T23:34:14.272Z"
  },
  "3": {
    "left": "<font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\">귀가 아프다</span></font><div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">&nbsp;아비소브로툴라</span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">아비소브로툴라 갈라테아이</span></span><br></font></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">해저열차라고 좀전에 하는데 귀가 지하에 들어가서 의미부여하는것이다.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">노이른슈테른익스프레스</span></span></div><div><br></div></div>",
    "right": "<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px !important;\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"></span></div><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">이를테면 서로간의 인사라는 것은 신뢰를바탕으로 한 서로의방어기제가 옅은색을띤얼굴로 몸을 내리는겁니다. 그것의 네페쉬, 네페쉬는동물의 혼이다</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">케텔은 인간이 존재의 의미를 인식할 수 있는 곳이다.</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">루아는 도덕적속성이며 때로는 지성적인 영으로 언급되기도한다 루아는 진정한 영이다.&nbsp;</span></span></div><div></div></span><div></div></span></span><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;씨발</div>",
    "date": "2026-01-20T23:36:44.664Z"
  },
  "4": {
    "left": "<br><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\">잠금쇠. 잠금.</span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\">돌고래가 심해에서도 살 수 있던가? 이빨고래.이빨고래라니까 뭔가 무섭기도 하고 귀엽기도 하고</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\">영국음식이 맛 없다던데 꽤나 괜찮았다. 요리사는 영국인이 아니지만, 독일제 열차에, 영국 요리도 아니었고, 도통 정체성을 모르겠다.</span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
    "right": "<div>창문 잠금쇠</div>조금 밀어보니 움직여서 이거 뭔가 잘못됨을 느낌.바로 원래대로 해두었다. <span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\">만</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\">지</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\">지</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\">말</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\">자.</span><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important; font-size: 16px !important;\">컨디션 좋아짐.</span></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">abcdefghijklmnop</font></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>정신병자 소굴</div>",
    "date": "2026-01-20T23:38:03.520Z"
  },
  "5": {
    "left": "<div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">비린내 난다.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">몰리 (성이 있었나)<br></span></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">친해지면 아무나 맘에 안드는 놈 하나쯤은 창문밖에 던지게 해주지 않을까?</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">꼬마 아가씨를 구해줬음</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div>빨간&nbsp;</div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">장갑이 부드럽다</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">서맨사</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 어려짐 (왜?)</font></div>",
    "right": "<font face=\"Nanum Pen Script\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\">이반.</span></span></span></font><div><font face=\"Nanum Pen Script\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\">좀 멍청하게 생기고 안경 쓴 군인</span></span></span></font></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">피부 검은놈이랑 붙어다님</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">(얘 좀 싸가지 없었다)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;소비에트 놈이었다</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">가명을 이반으로 쓰는 미친놈인데 왜 진즉에 KGB가 잡아가지 않았는지 놀라울따름&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">어떻게 살아있지?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\">돌팔이</span></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">말걸지 말걸 그랬다</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot;;\"><br></span></div><div><font face=\"Nanum Pen Script\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></font></div>",
    "date": "2026-01-20T23:40:19.637Z"
  },
  "6": {
    "left": "<span style=\"font-size: 18px !important;\"><br><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Myeongjo&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Pen Script&quot; !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 28px !important;\">페어차일드</span></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Myeongjo&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Pen Script&quot; !important;\"></span></span></div><div><font face=\"Nanum Brush Script\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Myeongjo&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\">아르메니안 계. 그... <span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">당뇨병 환자 </span><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">애새끼.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Nanum Brush Script\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Myeongjo&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Pen Script&quot; !important;\">10년 후 고위험군.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Pen Script&quot; !important;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Pen Script&quot; !important;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Nanum Brush Script\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Myeongjo&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Serif KR&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px !important;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Do Hyeon&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Pen Script&quot; !important;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><br></div><div>앤드류</div><div>앤디</div><div><br></div><div>내 약을 이 양반이 가지고 있었다.&nbsp;</div><div>수갑플 좋아함.</div>",
    "right": "<div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">개비싼 귀걸이</font></div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">낸시? (확실하지 않음)</font><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font><div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">손버릇 나쁨</font></div></div></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">꼬마 제스터 아가씨</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">뭔가 식기 이름이었는데</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">어려보인다.</font></div><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">몸은 튼튼해보여서 다행.</font></div>",
    "date": "2026-01-20T23:37:57.599Z"
  },
  "7": {
    "left": "<font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">그... 그...<span style=\"font-style: italic !important;\">​</span></font><div><font face=\"Noto Serif KR\">중국인 남자 애널리스트라던데</font></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>금발 시녀</div><div>부러운 근력이다.</div><div>안나</div><div><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;레즈였음</span></div><div>굳이 적어야하나?</div>",
    "right": "<span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">​라디오가 잘 나오지 않음. 새로 사줬어야했다</span></span><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">나중에 사주도록하자. 리버풀, 리버풀, 리버풀, 리버풀</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\"> Phenomenon</span><br></span></div>",
    "date": "2026-01-20T23:37:55.483Z"
  },
